The SVGs in this directory are extracted from Lucide and are distributed under
the ISC license reproduced below. They are generated, not authored here:
`scripts/generate-gpui-icons.mjs` reads the paths out of
`node_modules/lucide-react/dist/esm/icons` (and, for `auto-support.svg`,
`alert-diamond-custom.svg`, the project's own icons) and writes one file per
icon, keeping Lucide's `viewBox`, stroke attributes and path data unchanged.

Lucide is the maintained fork of Feather (MIT, Cole Bemis 2013–2022); the icon
set is at https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide.

